{"id":136,"name":"Höhé","slug":"hohe","logo":"storage/clients/hohe-d52a13386f.png","featured_image":"storage/projects/hohe-85ed03f7d6.jpg","title":null,"description":null,"website":null,"location":"locally","services":[{"name":"Branding","slug":"branding"},{"name":"Design","slug":"design"}],"industries":[{"name":"Produce","slug":"produce"},{"name":"Food","slug":"food"}],"projects":[{"id":160,"title":"The Sweet Companion","slug":"hohe","year":"2019","description":"We named it Höhé, we made its logo, we created its identity, designed the packaging and made it look the way it tastes - sweet, making you melt every time you see it, and making you want to buy it.","body_html":null,"cover_image":"storage/projects/hohe-85ed03f7d6.jpg","is_featured":true,"services":["Branding","Design"],"industries":["Produce","Food"],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>The first ever producer of stroopwafels in Kosova approached us to help them name and brand their product. The request was specific: to create a very presentable look for EU and domestic markets, yet keep a hint of its Albanian origin.</p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-3152540fd1.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>We came up with a name with a subtle, funny, yet meaningful detail that not many realize at first. This, accompanied by a great design, made this product one of the most popular biscuits in the market. </p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-d1305bc1de.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-53adf6c9f5.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-858ec998b9.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-bbb732fd41.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-48c988980f.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-541be2cd61.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-518f584e0d.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-3e11411632.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-e1ecd6823d.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-d7ea15d839.jpg","alt":""}}]}]}